                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I remember playing this game when I would take my ex to school on the bus every morning I would wake up with her and I would make sure she got to school on time. we were 2 years apart when we met at the time and she was in her senior year. I was in my first semester of college. this game brings back so much good memories of struggling and yeah. this is one of my favorite games. I was sad they took it off the play store.",
